000010* DIVIDE ... REMAINDER, and division by zero: ON SIZE ERROR
000020* runs and the receiving field keeps its old value.
000030 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000040 PROGRAM-ID. DIVREM.
000050 DATA DIVISION.
000060 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000070 01 A              PIC S9(4)V99.
000080 01 B              PIC S9(4)V99.
000090 01 Q              PIC S9(4).
000100 01 R              PIC S9(4)V99.
000110 01 Q2             PIC S9(4)V99.
000120 01 R2             PIC S9(4)V9(4).
000130 01 Z              PIC 9 VALUE 0.
000140 01 T              PIC S9(4)V99 VALUE 77.77.
000150 01 SHOW           PIC -9(4).99.
000160 01 SHOW4          PIC -9(4).9999.
000170 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
000180 MAIN-PARA.
000190     MOVE 17 TO A MOVE 5 TO B
000200     PERFORM SHOW-DIV
000210     MOVE -17 TO A MOVE 5 TO B
000220     PERFORM SHOW-DIV
000230     MOVE 17 TO A MOVE -5 TO B
000240     PERFORM SHOW-DIV
000250     MOVE 10.5 TO A MOVE 3 TO B
000260     PERFORM SHOW-DIV
000270     DIVIDE A BY B GIVING Q2 REMAINDER R2
000280     MOVE Q2 TO SHOW MOVE R2 TO SHOW4
000290     DISPLAY "DECIMALS " SHOW " R " SHOW4
000300     MOVE 20 TO A MOVE 3 TO B
000310     DIVIDE A BY B GIVING Q ROUNDED REMAINDER R
000320     MOVE R TO SHOW
000330     DISPLAY "ROUNDED  " Q " R " SHOW
000340     DIVIDE A BY Z GIVING Q REMAINDER R
000350        ON SIZE ERROR DISPLAY "ZERO DIVIDE: SIZE ERROR"
000360     END-DIVIDE
000370     MOVE 1234 TO Q MOVE T TO R
000380     DIVIDE A BY Z GIVING Q REMAINDER R
000390        ON SIZE ERROR CONTINUE
000400     END-DIVIDE
000410     MOVE R TO SHOW
000420     DISPLAY "UNCHANGED " Q " " SHOW
000430     COMPUTE T = A / Z * 2
000440        ON SIZE ERROR DISPLAY "COMPUTE /0: SIZE ERROR"
000450     END-COMPUTE
000460     MOVE T TO SHOW
000470     DISPLAY "T KEPT   " SHOW
000480     STOP RUN.
000490 SHOW-DIV.
000500     DIVIDE A BY B GIVING Q REMAINDER R
000510     MOVE R TO SHOW
